---
title: Analyze Media & Extract Identities
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as WordPress Plugin
    participant API as /recognition/analyze
    participant Session as AsyncSession + tenant context
    participant Queue as ScanQueueService
    participant BG as BackgroundTasks (populate queue)
    participant Worker as scan_worker.py
    participant ScanSvc as ScanService
    participant Detector as FaceDetectorProtocol
    participant Generator as EmbeddingGeneratorProtocol
    participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
    participant Thumbs as Thumbnail storage

    Note over Client,DB: Legend: ENTRY = external entrypoint, Dashed arrow = optional wiring
    Note over Client,DB: Mini-map: ENTRY: POST /recognition/analyze -> ScanQueueService -> SqlAlchemyScanQueueRepository, Worker: recognition/worker/scan_worker.py, ScanSvc: recognition/application/scan/service.py

    Client->>API: ENTRY: POST /recognition/analyze {tenant_id, media_items[], user_id?}
    API->>Session: set_tenant_context and ensure tenant exists
    API->>Queue: create_scan_job_record(total, user_id)
    API->>BG: add_task(populate_scan_job_items, job_id, media_items)
    API-->>Client: 202 accepted {job_id, status=pending}

    BG->>Session: async_session_factory()
    BG->>Queue: populate_scan_job_items(job_id, media_items)
    Queue->>DB: INSERT identity_scan_job_items

    alt async worker processing
        Worker->>DB: claim pending IdentityScanJobItem via SKIP LOCKED
        Worker->>ScanSvc: process_media_item(tenant_id, media_url)
        ScanSvc->>Detector: detect(media_url)
        ScanSvc->>Generator: generate(face_bytes) if missing embeddings
        ScanSvc->>DB: insert MediaIdentity rows
        ScanSvc->>DB: update job item status
        Worker->>Queue: refresh_job_progress(job_id)
        Queue->>DB: update IdentityScanJob status/progress
        Worker->>Thumbs: write thumbnails (optional)
    else inline processing (RECOGNITION_ASYNC_ANALYZE_INLINE=1)
        API->>ScanSvc: process_scan_job(job_id, media_items)
        ScanSvc->>Detector: detect(media_url)
        ScanSvc->>Generator: generate(face_bytes)
        ScanSvc->>DB: insert MediaIdentity rows
        ScanSvc->>DB: update IdentityScanJob status/progress
        ScanSvc->>Thumbs: write thumbnails (optional)
    end
